  "segments": [
    {
      "s": 0.0,
      "e": 4.44,
      "text": "This is Quinton and Jeff, and they turned a family tradition into a platform that has raised"
    },
    {
      "s": 4.44,
      "e": 7.12,
      "text": "1.3 million euros to challenge."
    },
    {
      "s": 7.56,
      "e": 11.78,
      "text": "This ID started together with my dad. He already has the Parkinson's disease for 15 years."
    },
    {
      "s": 12.12,
      "e": 16.48,
      "text": "Every hospital checkup, I send him a message with, I'm lighting a candle for you to wish you"
    },
    {
      "s": 16.48,
      "e": 19.96,
      "text": "good luck. He came up with the ID, what if he could light a candle with a phone,"
    },
    {
      "s": 20.24,
      "e": 23.06,
      "text": "and at the same time could raise money for the Parkinson's disease."
    },
    {
      "s": 23.34,
      "e": 26.12,
      "text": "To bring it to life, Quinton called his longtime friend Jeff."
    },
    {
      "s": 26.12,
      "e": 30.5,
      "text": "Quinton and I spoke for the first time to gym class, and it was like the, you know,"
    },
    {
      "s": 30.58,
      "e": 35.3,
      "text": "the typical Spider-Man meme where you're meeting the exact same type of guy."
    },
    {
      "s": 35.54,
      "e": 38.48,
      "text": "Together, they started building Weeclow, and over the next five years,"
    },
    {
      "s": 38.64,
      "e": 41.32,
      "text": "they spoke to every non-profit in Belgium and the Netherlands."
    },
    {
      "s": 41.92,
      "e": 45.56,
      "text": "The more people they spoke to, the more they learned, and the bigger the problem became."
    },
    {
      "s": 45.82,
      "e": 51.9,
      "text": "Non-profits have two options, super expensive sales, where they pay thousands of euros every"
    },
    {
      "s": 51.9,
      "e": 56.42,
      "text": "year, or they have like three platforms where they aren't the owner of the donor data,"
    },
    {
      "s": 56.42,
      "e": 59.58,
      "text": "and they don't receive the donations right through their bank account."
    },
    {
      "s": 59.74,
      "e": 63.36,
      "text": "So we really saw a big problem there. So our nice idea of lighting a candle"
    },
    {
      "s": 63.36,
      "e": 66.3,
      "text": "and the big non-profit problem, we combine it."
    },
    {
      "s": 66.52,
      "e": 69.92,
      "text": "But Weeclow wasn't bill overnight. Well, not initially."
    },
    {
      "s": 70.4,
      "e": 73.88,
      "text": "We spent a lot of money and we spent a lot of cash into trying to build that software,"
    },
    {
      "s": 74.06,
      "e": 77.54,
      "text": "and it took us a lot of time. It was a very hard time because we have a,"
    },
    {
      "s": 77.54,
      "e": 81.68,
      "text": "we had a big dream, but we didn't have like the funds to invest in like a"
    },
    {
      "s": 81.68,
      "e": 88.12,
      "text": "developer team. But our mission was so bright and we had so much passion to launch this platform."
    },
    {
      "s": 88.36,
      "e": 93.26,
      "text": "Then in one day, I made everything we already had on Weeclow, where we built it years for."
    },
    {
      "s": 93.52,
      "e": 97.28,
      "text": "We had it in one day on low. We are free for really low cost,"
    },
    {
      "s": 97.5,
      "e": 101.22,
      "text": "and all the money will go directly to your bank account, and you are also the owner"
    },
    {
      "s": 101.22,
      "e": 106.42,
      "text": "of the donor data. We cover everything, donations, CRM, Weeclow mail,"
    },
    {
      "s": 106.42,
      "e": 111.02,
      "text": "even newsletters. We can do everything that the non-profit needs to start in digital fundraising."
    },
    {
      "s": 111.42,
      "e": 116.1,
      "text": "What started as a tradition between father and son could now be shared by millions across the world."
    },
    {
      "s": 116.56,
      "e": 119.7,
      "text": "For the growth we had last year, it's something we dreamed of."
    },
    {
      "s": 120.24,
      "e": 123.94,
      "text": "We lighted more than 35,000 candles, raised more than 1.3 million."
    },
    {
      "s": 124.22,
      "e": 129.62,
      "text": "We've seen so many great campaigns from people doing 100 kilometer runs"
    },
    {
      "s": 130.32,
      "e": 134.26,
      "text": "from one point to another to people cycling across Europe."
    },
    {
      "s": 134.26,
      "e": 138.24,
      "text": "For my dad to see all these campaigns coming up, he's super proud."
    },
    {
      "s": 138.62,
      "e": 141.48,
      "text": "Like he really sent me and Jeff a message with."
    },
    {
      "s": 141.74,
      "e": 144.4,
      "text": "So nice for you guys. I'm so proud of you guys."
    },
    {
      "s": 144.7,
      "e": 150.06,
      "text": "So for him, it's also a dream just to his ID to see in reality. It's amazing to see."
    }
  ]
}
